{"version":"1.0.0","enabled":true,"name":"eve-sdl-sh-fallback","description":"Legacy (pre-1.0 IDE) twin of eve-sdl-sh-fallback.json. Pre-1.0 has no SessionStart trigger, so it fires on promptSubmit (same fallback as eve-sdl-preflight.kiro.hook / eve-sdl-win-precheck.kiro.hook). Windows-only sh->PowerShell fallback: runs under bun and, ONLY when on Windows with a POSIX `sh` NOT on PATH (or AIDLC_SDL_FORCE_PS1=1), runs the native PowerShell twins eve-sdl-install-precommit.ps1 and eve-sdl-preflight.ps1. Silent no-op on macOS/Linux and on Windows WITH sh. Never blocks.","when":{"type":"promptSubmit"},"then":{"type":"runCommand","command":"bun .kiro/hooks/eve-sdl-sh-fallback.ts"}}
